==English==

===Adverb===
{{infl|en|adverb}}

# In a [[relative]] manner; often used in lists, to clearly indicate that two (or more) separate items or lists correspond to each other, in terms of order.
#:''[[w:Serena Williams|Serena Williams]] and [[w:Roger Federer|Roger Federer]] won the women's and men's singles titles, '''respectively''', at the 2008 U.S. Open.

